- [ ] Establish partnerships with industry leaders to secure funding, resources, and expertise.
- [ ] Continuously monitor and improve the studio's infrastructure, technologies, and business model.

### Phase 4 — Launch / Completion (12 weeks)
- [ ] Launch a flagship game that showcases the studio's technological prowess and innovative approach.
- [ ] Evaluate the success of the launch and adjust the strategy as needed to ensure continued growth and competitiveness.

## Estimated Timeline
| Phase | Estimated Duration |
|---|---|
